	measure 'Working Capital Driver Value' = ```
			
			 SWITCH(
			    SELECTEDVALUE('Working Capital Drivers'[Driver]),
			
			    "Accounts Receivable",
			        CALCULATE(
			            [Actual Amount],
			            REMOVEFILTERS(DimIndicator),
			            DimIndicator[IndicatorCode] = "CHG_AR"
			        ),
			    "Inventory",
			        CALCULATE(
			            [Actual Amount],
			            REMOVEFILTERS(DimIndicator),
			            DimIndicator[IndicatorCode] = "CHG_INV"
			        ),
			
			    "Accounts Payable",
			        - CALCULATE(
			            [Actual Amount],
			            REMOVEFILTERS(DimIndicator),
			            DimIndicator[IndicatorCode] = "CHG_AP"
			        )
			 )
			```
		lineageTag: a2bb7200-0a9c-4f65-ab2a-91ca82ad3b44

		annotation PBI_FormatHint = {"isGeneralNumber":true}

	measure 'Cash Flow Structure Value' =
			
